# Local development secrets. Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in.
# In production this is a Worker secret: `cf workers secrets update VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY`.
#
# Web Push private key (base64url, P-256 scalar). Generate a matching pair with:
#   npx web-push generate-vapid-keys
# and put the public key in `cloudflare.config.ts` as VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY.
VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
